WEBVTT

00:06:30.261 --> 00:06:31.971
And that's liberating.

00:06:32.555 --> 00:06:35.099
It's also sometimes quite nerve-wracking.

00:06:35.683 --> 00:06:37.518
And what it means is that people say,

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.687
"Well, if I want to put
a dog in my family,

00:06:39.728 --> 00:06:41.063
I'm going to put a dog."

00:06:41.564 --> 00:06:43.941
It also means that people use dogs

00:06:43.983 --> 00:06:47.862
to define and create families
as an active choice.

00:06:47.862 --> 00:06:51.198
And what is interesting
is that the issue at stake here

00:06:51.198 --> 00:06:54.118
is not about the human
and the dog relationship,

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.620
let alone your dog
versus dog relationship,

00:06:56.662 --> 00:06:58.998
it's humans to humans.